---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`Important information about the limits of ${site.name}’s calculators and content.`}
  path="/disclaimer/"
  updated="2026-09-25"
  lede="Our calculators are designed to help you understand your options. They are not a substitute for professional advice."
>
  <h2>Educational information only</h2>
  <p>
    The calculators, articles and examples on {site.name} are for general educational purposes. They do not take into account
    your full financial situation, objectives or needs, and they are not financial, investment, credit, tax, legal, insurance,
    Medicare or Social Security advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Results are estimates</h2>
  <p>Every result depends on the numbers you enter and on simplifying assumptions, which each page explains. For example:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Loan and credit card calculators apply interest monthly; lenders usually charge interest daily and may change rates or fees.</li>
    <li>Tax calculators use federal brackets and standard deductions for the selected year and exclude credits, other income, payroll taxes and state taxes.</li>
    <li>ACA, Medicare IRMAA and Social Security figures come from published government tables that are updated each year; agencies make the final determination.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Your actual loan offer, tax bill, premium or benefit may differ. Before acting, confirm the numbers with your lender, a tax
    professional, a licensed insurance agent or Marketplace navigator, an attorney, or the relevant government agency.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Using the site or contacting us does not create an adviser–client, attorney–client or any other professional relationship.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and updates</h2>
  <p>
    We check our formulas against primary sources and update figures when agencies publish new numbers — see our
    <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>. Even so, rules change and mistakes happen. If you spot an error, please
    <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name} is supported by advertising, including ads served by Google AdSense. Advertisers do not review, approve or
    influence our calculators or content, and we are not paid based on which products you choose. The appearance of an
    advertisement is not an endorsement of the advertiser or its products.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    We link to official and third-party websites for reference. We aren’t responsible for the content or accuracy of external
    sites.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
